### Create weight record
POST {{host}}/api/health/weight-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": "",
  "weightDate": "",
  "weight": 4.80
}

### Get weight history
GET {{host}}/api/health/weight-records?petId={{petId}}&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create vaccine
POST {{host}}/api/health/vaccines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": "",
  "vaccinationDate": "",
  "vaccineName": "",
  "nextDueDate": ""
}
